  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello VRChat team,\n\nCurrently, hand tracking via SteamVR works well visually using Quest 2 + ALVR or AirLink. However, movement with hand gestures (like on standalone Quest) does not work on PCVR.\n\nIt would be great to bring the same hand-based locomotion system (e.g. gesture walking, turning, jumping) to PCVR for people using hand tracking without controllers.\n\nThis would improve immersion and accessibility for many Quest 2 users playing VRChat via PCVR.\n\nThank you for considering!",
